libeasyfc
------------------------------------------
libeasyfc is an interface library to generate fontconfig configuration for user
preferences. this supports to assign your preferrable fonts to the alias fonts,
such as sans-serif, serif and monospace per languages.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  girepository-GLib2.0-1.86.0-2
  girepository-x11-1.86.0-2
  libeasyfc-devel-0.14.1-1bl2
  libeasyfc-gobject-devel-0.14.1-1bl2
  libeasyfc-gobject0-0.14.1-1bl2
  libeasyfc0-0.14.1-1bl2
  libfontconfig-devel-2.18.4-1
  libfontconfig1-2.18.4-1
  libfreetype-devel-2.13.3-1
  libfreetype6-2.13.3-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libharfbuzz-devel-15.1.0-1
  libharfbuzz0-15.1.0-1
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-3
  libxml2_2-2.13.9-3
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

