Canonical website:
  https://bitbucket.org/tagoh/libeasyfc/

Canonical download:
  https://bitbucket.org/tagoh/libeasyfc/downloads/libeasyfc-0.14.1.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libeasyfc-0.14.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libeasyfc-0.14.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libeasyfc-0.14.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libeasyfc-0.14.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libeasyfc0-0.14.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libeasyfc-devel-0.14.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libeasyfc-gobject0-0.14.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libeasyfc-gobject-devel-0.14.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/girepository-Easyfc0.14-0.14.1-X.tar.xz

